---
# Vendored SameBoy APU — do NOT reformat.
#
# `DisableFormat: true` tells clang-format to leave every file in this
# directory tree alone. `SortIncludes: false` is redundant once
# DisableFormat is on, but is included for defense-in-depth in case a
# future clang-format release changes the semantics of DisableFormat.
#
# This directory is maintained by `SOURCE.md`'s refresh procedure —
# byte-identity to upstream SameBoy `Core/apu.{c,h}` and `LICENSE` is
# enforced by `diff -q`. Any local clang-format rewrite would silently
# break that invariant and corrupt the vendor diff against upstream.
#
# See the co-located `SOURCE.md` and the repo-root `THIRD_PARTY.md` for
# the vendor discipline policy this exclusion implements.

DisableFormat: true
SortIncludes: false
